---
description: >-
  When the user parks work (not now, later, skip for now, add a
  TODO/FIXME/HACK/BUG/ALT/XXX), write a Todo Tree hashtag on the live
  OpenSpec spec or design — not an Open Question, Requirement, or Decision
alwaysApply: false
---

Write `#TODO:` / `#FIXME:` / `#ALT:` / `#BUG:` / `#HACK:` / `#XXX:` (no space after `#`) on the living file. Prefer `- #TODO: …` under the relevant Requirement, Decision, or Purpose.

- Behavior → `openspec/specs/<capability-path>/spec.md`
- Architecture → `openspec/design/<design-domain>/design.md`
- Unsure or missing file → ask once. Do not invent SHALL/MUST or a Decision to hold a tag.

Explicit tag request = consent. Implementation is `- [ ]` in `tasks.md`, not a tag.
